{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の口の中には友達が2人います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいつの名は口内炎だー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑うと痛いので微笑むことしかできません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"26日の握手会で私がずっと微笑んでたら『あ、口内炎まだ治ってないんだ!』って思ってください( ´･ᴗ･` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、たくさん笑いたいから意地でも治すぞー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いてててて。ってなるのがちょこっと好きで刺激するから治らないんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そっとしておこう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むにむにほっぺ〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7P4R2FNJRTQR0NHC0EAQ9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"}